{"hw":"ἄριστον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἄριστον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἄριστον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">morning meal, breakfast,</b> twice in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐντύνοντ' ἄ. ἅμ' ἠοῖ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.2</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24.124</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἄριστα, δεῖπνα, δόρπα θ' αἱρεῖσθαι τρίτα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">182</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">331</span> </span>: later, <b class=\"lex-tr\">breakfast</b> was called <span class=\"gk\">ἀκράτισμα,</span> and <span class=\"gk\">ἄριστον</span> was the midday meal, our <b class=\"lex-tr\">luncheon,</b> cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.90</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.81</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἄ. αἱρεῖσθαι, ποιεῖσθαι,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.26</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.78</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀπ' ἀρίστου μέχρι δείλης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">619a15</span> </span>. [<span class=\"gk\">α</span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">contr.</span> </span> from <span class=\"gk\">α</span>(<b class=\"lex-tr\">y</b>)<span class=\"gk\">ερι-στον,</span> cf. Goth. <b class=\"lex-tr\">air,</b> OHG. <b class=\"lex-tr\">ēr</b> 'early', Avest. <b class=\"lex-tr\">ayar[schwa]</b> 'day'; also <span class=\"gk\">α</span>(<b class=\"lex-tr\">y</b>)<span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ερ</span>- in <span class=\"gk\">ἦρι, ἠέριος; -στο-</span> from <b class=\"lex-tr\">-d-to-,</b> root <b class=\"lex-tr\">ed-</b> 'eat'.]</div></div>"}